{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1826.unity3d","item_key":"commands[2].text","source_sha256":"fd1c0dbbcf8e989684b3e0c741951cf75afdc747c4bcc3d14b2eaf5b8e8dae9e","ja":"スカウト、撃退！","zh":"击退星探！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1826.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"d2ff12e4218a811cf52a567c8b1728ed08dfa6eba7ef940ec37f81aae2009bbe","ja":"その翌日、ジュリアが路上ライブをしていると……","zh":"第二天，茱莉亚正在进行街头演出时……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1826.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"e18f2662eac9705a683793aa69cc1fd1ca134609016a548231ff2c58bf3d637e","ja":"「キミ、ギターも歌もすごい上に、ビジュもいいね！\nもしよかったら……」","zh":"「你的吉他和歌声都很棒，外形也很不错！\n如果你愿意的话……」","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1826.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"9a106e79218a323626942b95bfc9812ca7866d041e231b964b4244486c8f6b6f","ja":"悪いけど、演奏を邪魔するような無粋なやつの話は\n聞く気はないんだ。話しかけないでくれ！","zh":"抱歉，我没兴趣听妨碍演奏的\n没品家伙说话。别来跟我搭话！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1826.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"33fbf1bcb545f2f0833fe6b541fd8ec0688063e9ed7f1714bdf4ecfa05741de3","ja":"はぁ～、路上ライブだけじゃなくて、スカウトを\n撃退するジュリアちゃんまで見られるなんて……。","zh":"哈啊～，不光能看到街头演出，\n连击退星探的茱莉亚也能看到……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1826.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"de6757acaabcece469393a5852a196b142b76665e4f873d6059a946dcb6ed703","ja":"ありさ、なんてラッキーなんでしょう！\n怒った表情も、最高にかっこよくてしびれますぅ～！","zh":"亚利沙真是太幸运了！\n就连生气的表情也帅气得让人心醉～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1826.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"c33e98429893304de3ab8aaad020484e1e48eb1d3f40071717a477e0b4eb70cd","ja":"「ねえねえ、そこのキミ！\nすごく可愛いね！　モデルに興味ないかな？」","zh":"「喂喂，你那边的！\n超级可爱！对当模特有兴趣吗？」","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1826.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"61242cd79237d761f44b678c9bc5a9cf4dcc970cc718a77dc9277e6257db02dd","ja":"……はぁ……ジュリアちゃんが目の前にいると\nいうのに、ありさに声をかけるなんて……。","zh":"……唉……茱莉亚明明就在眼前，\n居然还来搭讪亚利沙……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1826.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"3bed88469e0af5ff43aaa742af1bf84c999d4db1ad0dac01d69335662d57ad30","ja":"センスがないにもほどがあります！\nもっと見る目を養ってから出直してきてくださいっ！","zh":"审美也太差了！\n先培养好眼光再来吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1826.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"27fe5f1873372f5819faa3331a1cffe4365bae7c4a79d9f7ba5fb21c539be8b3","ja":"「ひえぇっ！　す、すみませんでした～！」","zh":"「呀啊！对、对不起～！」","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1826.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"64cd68f3c8ecbd9dd8a2ea26f1be023b68b4b0abb6e4af294b31c7e77cc3845f","ja":"一方その頃、\n歌織と麗花にも怪しい影が迫っていて……","zh":"与此同时，\n歌织和丽花身边也逼近着可疑的影子……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1826.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"f5f5d43d98616a98f7929b14bf4a76ca65bb0061b7f4e5781d6c487e9e9c921e","ja":"「キミたち、ふたりとも可愛いね！\nよかったら、ちょっと話さない？」","zh":"「你们两个都好可爱！\n要是方便的话，能聊聊吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1826.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"4d07766cd7b98ec37ef80381af1f27f9b29d03d750961a564db4c29020e25ae0","ja":"あの、私たちはすでに所属している\n事務所があるので、そういうお話は……。","zh":"那个，我们已经有所属的事务所了\n所以那种话题……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1826.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"383db2beee9da01d073e2313d7ef9a225c817bd7680f21027a9f691d180322a2","ja":"それに私たち、今からハイキングに行くので、\nお話を聞いている時間はないんです！","zh":"再说了，我们现在就要去远足，\n没时间听你说话！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1826.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"c2d0fcc0a15b49f3f7472bf7425a9019887660e9c061963d9a9c9264ecfaa7b5","ja":"「オレがハイキングよりも楽しいところに\nつれてってあげるからさ。ね、ちょっと話そうよ」","zh":"我带你们去比远足更有趣的地方\n来，跟我聊聊吧","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1826.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"a13e9ad311207cdacf863da222542856c5284f8596a23a5123b4a1133d8d31b5","ja":"「あ、どうしてもって言うなら、オレも行くよ。\n3人で遊んだほうが、ゼッタイ楽しいって！」","zh":"「啊，你们要是坚持的话，我也一起去。\n3人一起玩，绝对更开心！」","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1826.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"b433916b4303114674cedc9690903bf4371c7bc1f6bd30fccf296988c58d74ae","ja":"（あっ、この人、スカウトじゃなくてナンパだわ！）","zh":"啊，这个人不是来招募的，是来搭讪的！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1826.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"633fba1cade5fd3af2471dc301044ec78e517f1c84d79f6b9e93730401b80c97","ja":"ナ、ナンパもスカウトも遠慮させていただきます！\n行きましょう、麗花ちゃん！","zh":"搭、搭讪和星探都请容我谢绝！\n丽花，我们走吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1826.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"4ff40387ba2cdf7ba9565e257e9dfcd195a6cd4ceee62b974721b1547e68b933","ja":"はーい。それじゃあ、失礼しまーす♪","zh":"好的。那么，我们就告辞了♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
